---
description: >-
  Routine code review (fast, Sonnet). Use after writing or modifying code for everyday changes: UI,
  small features, bug fixes, tests, config, docs, contained refactors. MUST BE USED for code changes
  unless the change is high-risk — then use deep-reviewer INSTEAD (never both on the same change).
  If its report starts with "ESCALATE:", run deep-reviewer on the same change next.
mode: subagent
model: claude-agent/sonnet
permissions:
  - action: edit
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "git diff*"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git log*"
    effect: allow
  - action: shell
    resource: "git show*"
    effect: allow
  # Minus flags that write files or run programs, and anything zsh would
  # expand into something else (as in security-auditor.md.tmpl).
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--output*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--ext-diff*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--textconv*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "git * -O*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--config-env*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--git-dir*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--work-tree*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*--exec-path*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*GIT_*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*>*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*<*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*'*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*\"*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*$*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*`*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*{*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*(*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*\\*"
    effect: deny
  - action: shell
    resource: "*\t*"
    effect: deny
---

